 ("Creation to Malachi","Prophecy","God deals with the world through Israel: promise, law, kingdom, prophets — all foretelling an earthly kingdom under Messiah."),
 ("The Gospels","Prophecy","Christ ministers to Israel as “a minister of the circumcision” (Romans 15:8), offering the kingdom to the nation."),
 ("Acts 1–8","Prophecy","Pentecost and the twelve continue the kingdom offer to Israel; the prophetic program runs on."),
